          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau Besalel anaŋga ŋina aya ŋiraŋgi lu: Ŋolopus, ŋolo kipurat-areŋan areŋan ka ŋolo areŋan, ŋina adonyuno ejok a ŋiusyo a ŋulu amilimilak, todonyok ŋitorubei a Ŋisubuna ejok nen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau iŋes anakito ke eewoi ŋipirin ŋiomwon ŋulu inenekinio anaŋga ŋin, ido toburusikis egolid lopirin ŋul, kitiyau iŋes ke egolid ŋikodoce akodakinia anaŋga ŋin lopirin ŋul, ido tosipok ŋipirin ŋul kidiama esilipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ iŋes kitiyau anaŋga ŋina ke epuke a Eema a ŋolo iryamununoi eya ŋiraŋgi lu: Ŋolopus, ŋolo kipurat-areŋan areŋan ka ŋolo areŋan, anaŋga ŋina adonyuno ejok a ŋiusyo a ŋulu amilimilak, todonyokinitetei ŋitorubei ŋulu esibusitere; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ido toyakas ŋipirin keŋ ŋikan kaapei ka ŋikodoce kec, toburusik iŋes egolid kidiama ka kwap ŋipirin ŋul, ido kitiyau ke eburonis ŋawoeta a ŋipirin a ŋul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.38"
            ]
          }
